    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/209df0ae3019b2b4e43f977750413eb1.avif?t=1743080192\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit a squad of elite mercenaries, experts in post-apocalyptic zombie combat. Battle relentless hordes of the undead as you explore a 3D world revealed through the cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/ca7b0710d41815761c7190c76103a1f5.avif?t=1743080192\" /></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your tactical approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Go silent to keep the noise down to face the enemy one by one.   <br>\u00bb Go loud with explosives and guns, taking on the alerted undead all at once!<br>\u00bb Set them on fire, blow them to pieces, slice and dice your orchestrated zombie funeral.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/798dc338ba8fadc0c8ab087064e2a4df.poster.avif?t=1743080192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/798dc338ba8fadc0c8ab087064e2a4df.webm?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/798dc338ba8fadc0c8ab087064e2a4df.mp4?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f3510c044f43264d4aa3ad44ca6b9e62.poster.avif?t=1743080192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f3510c044f43264d4aa3ad44ca6b9e62.webm?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f3510c044f43264d4aa3ad44ca6b9e62.mp4?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/13111fcc4bec22f92ffae691038abf26.poster.avif?t=1743080192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/13111fcc4bec22f92ffae691038abf26.webm?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/13111fcc4bec22f92ffae691038abf26.mp4?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/a58dadf32201560924610e32cf1b4f26.avif?t=1743080192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 15 mercenary characters, each individually voiced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 5 classes with 15 unique skill trees and unlimited respecs for optimal experimentation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 150 skills and passive abilities allowing for a wide range of creative combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 40 passive Elite Perks, randomly discovered through the combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 17 weapon attributes to fine-tune the combat style your mercs even further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Challenge modes with individual Steam Leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 320+ Steam achievements, view your progression directly in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f6d736d466278a373379379a51f22e77.avif?t=1743080192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Find and upgrade hundreds of weapons, consumables and gadgets for your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Discover unique items that enhance your skills and transform your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Meet survivors to join your camp, where they\u2019ll assist you in future missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Complete special assignments from survivors to earn powerful rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Reanimate the undead to  transform into a special class, called Revenant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f1ff903f6b136b66555944cabb6075d0.webp?t=1743080192\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit a squad of elite mercenaries, experts in post-apocalyptic zombie combat. Battle relentless hordes of the undead as you explore a 3D world revealed through the cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/ca7b0710d41815761c7190c76103a1f5.avif?t=1743080192\" /></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your tactical approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Go silent to keep the noise down to face the enemy one by one.   <br>\u00bb Go loud with explosives and guns, taking on the alerted undead all at once!<br>\u00bb Set them on fire, blow them to pieces, slice and dice your orchestrated zombie funeral.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/798dc338ba8fadc0c8ab087064e2a4df.poster.avif?t=1743080192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/798dc338ba8fadc0c8ab087064e2a4df.webm?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/798dc338ba8fadc0c8ab087064e2a4df.mp4?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f3510c044f43264d4aa3ad44ca6b9e62.poster.avif?t=1743080192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f3510c044f43264d4aa3ad44ca6b9e62.webm?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f3510c044f43264d4aa3ad44ca6b9e62.mp4?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/13111fcc4bec22f92ffae691038abf26.poster.avif?t=1743080192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/13111fcc4bec22f92ffae691038abf26.webm?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/13111fcc4bec22f92ffae691038abf26.mp4?t=1743080192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/a58dadf32201560924610e32cf1b4f26.avif?t=1743080192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 15 mercenary characters, each individually voiced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 5 classes with 15 unique skill trees and unlimited respecs for optimal experimentation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 150 skills and passive abilities allowing for a wide range of creative combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 40 passive Elite Perks, randomly discovered through the combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 17 weapon attributes to fine-tune the combat style your mercs even further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Challenge modes with individual Steam Leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 320+ Steam achievements, view your progression directly in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f6d736d466278a373379379a51f22e77.avif?t=1743080192\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Find and upgrade hundreds of weapons, consumables and gadgets for your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Discover unique items that enhance your skills and transform your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Meet survivors to join your camp, where they\u2019ll assist you in future missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Complete special assignments from survivors to earn powerful rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Reanimate the undead to  transform into a special class, called Revenant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f1ff903f6b136b66555944cabb6075d0.webp?t=1743080192\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Dead Grid is a turn-based strategy game set in a post-apocalyptic, zombie-infested world. Assemble a squad of elite mercenaries to battle hordes of the undead, aid local survivors, and upgrade your camp with hundreds of collected items.",
